    "Dentro de mi habitación, miré a mi alrededor en busca de quien me visitó la noche anterior mientras estaba fuera..."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:755
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_71efd66c:

    # "One such letter was addressed to me with a formal seal, that when opened, was written in bold capitalized writing."
    "Una de esas cartas iba dirigida a mí con un sello formal que, al abrirla, estaba escrito en mayúsculas y negrita."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:756
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_f4b0215e:

    # "{b}YOU WILL APPRECIATE YOUR GIFT AND ENJOY IT GREATLY MORE THAN ALL THE OTHER GIFTS YOU RECIEVE - HAPPY KRISHANA DAY - Captain Nyx.{/b}"
    "{b}APRECIARÁS TU REGALO Y LO DISFRUTARÁS MUCHO MÁS QUE TODOS LOS DEMÁS REGALOS QUE RECIBAS - FELIZ DÍA DE KRISHANA - Capitana Nyx.{/b}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:775
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_821d11b7:

    # "A well-crafted sword sat next to the letter, and despite it's sharpness and sturdyness, the thing was undoubtedly light as a feather."
    "Junto a la carta había una espada bien elaborada que, a pesar de su filo y robustez, era ligera como una pluma."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:776
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_8bc7ea7d:

    # "Its hilt was decorated in an exquisite manner: flowery patterns contrasted with aggressive, sharp lines."
    "Su empuñadura estaba decorada de forma exquisita: motivos florales contrastaban con líneas agresivas y afiladas."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:777
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_3a17669f:

    # "I remembered seeing Alderian officers carry weapons of a similar design."
    "Recordaba haber visto a oficiales alderianos llevar armas de diseño similar."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:778
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ad60b698:

    # "Admiring the sword I couldn't help but chuckle at Nyx's clumsy romantic abruptness..."
    "Admirando la espada no pude evitar soltar una risita ante la torpe brusquedad romántica de Nyx..."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:762
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_fbefc6fb:

    # "There was a small letter with an expensive looking gem that had been encased into a necklace."
    "Había una pequeña carta con una gema de aspecto caro engarzada en un collar."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:763
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_c50fd017:

    # "{i}I found this pure gem amongst the others you collected for me, and thought it'd make a nice gift, you can sell it if you wish, just don't bloody expect this cutesy nonsense all the time! - Happy Krishana day, Yours always, Arlena{/i}"
    "{i}Encontré esta joya pura entre las otras que coleccionaste para mí, y pensé que sería un bonito regalo, puedes venderla si lo deseas, ¡solo no esperes esta maldita tontería cursi todo el tiempo! - Feliz día de Krishana, con cariño, Arlena{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:764
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_fd007d73:

    # "I smirked, knowing Arlena likely spent considerable hours tidying up the crude gem and encasing it into the necklace ... It will likely fetch a pretty coin."
    "Sonreí con satisfacción, sabiendo que Arlena probablemente había pasado muchas horas arreglando la tosca gema y encajándola en el collar... Seguramente valdrá una buena cantidad de monedas."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:789
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_693fe49d:

    # "A letter was attached, and with it was one, beautiful amulet radiating some kind of magecraft."
    "Una carta estaba adjunta, y con ella un hermoso amuleto que irradiaba algún tipo de magia."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:769
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_c3319dd4:

    # "{i}When I am around you, the years of loneliness seem to fade away...  thank you, for making me feel what it means to be cared for - Happy Krishana day, my beast, your darling, - Sister Divine{/i}"
    "{i}Cuando estoy cerca de ti, los años de soledad parecen desvanecerse... gracias, por hacerme sentir lo que significa ser cuidada - Feliz día de Krishana, mi bestia, tu querida, - Hermana Divine{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:791
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_9f2b68b0:

    # "I stared down at the amulet, such a thing would normally be reserved for only those of much higher esteem than myself."
    "Me quedé mirando el amuleto, algo que normalmente estaría reservado solo para aquellos de mucha más alta estima que yo."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:792
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ef2cf4b1:

    # "I felt the maddening encroach of my infection slow even just holding it to inspect..."
    "Sentí que la enloquecedora invasión de mi infección se ralentizaba incluso solo al sostenerla para inspeccionarla..."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:776
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_b77d913f:

    # "There was what seemed to be a letter, somewhat poorly written with some food attached."
    "Había lo que parecía ser una carta, algo mal escrita y con algo de comida incluida."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:777
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_8ceb3953:

    # "{i}We do not celebrate this day in Ramon, but, I think it is important to you, so here is a gift my love - Love, Nijah. Iz my writing getting better?{/i}"
    "{i}No celebramos este día en Ramon, pero, creo que es importante para ti, así que aquí está un regalo mi amor - Amor, Nijah. ¿Ez mi escritura cada vez mejor?{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:798
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_85c5c414:

    # "The food looked delicious, and even though it was now a little cold, no doubt I could eat it in the morning."
    "La comida tenía muy buena pinta y, aunque ahora estaba un poco fría, sin duda podría comerla por la mañana."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:801
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ce363925:

    # "A note was hastily attached to a shiny, ruby encrusted ring that seemed to radiate some kind of light energy."
    "Una nota estaba apresuradamente unida a un anillo brillante con incrustaciones de rubí que parecía irradiar algún tipo de energía luminosa."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:802
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_109711fa:

    # "{i}Look, just because you're an adventurer dear, doesn't mean you're excused from being unfashionable, hope this helps - yours truly, D.{/i}"
    "{i}Mira, solo porque seas un aventurero querido, no significa que estés excusado de no estar a la moda, espero que esto te ayude - de corazón, D.{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:805
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_78754af7:

    # "My thoughts lingered towards the elven shopkeeper, and I smirked at the thought of Dros no doubt carefully picking out the right ring for me."
    "Mis pensamientos se dirigieron hacia en el comerciante elfo, y sonreí al imaginar a Dros eligiendo cuidadosamente el anillo adecuado para mí."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:805
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ae8ca6ba:

    # "The real question is, how did they know it would fit perfectly?"
    "La verdadera pregunta es, ¿cómo sabían que encajaría perfectamente?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:792
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_d5c7648c:

    # "Elena approached me with a book in her mouth."
    "Elena se me acercó con un libro en la boca."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:793
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_969ad7cc:

    # ELENA "BARK!"
    ELENA "¡LADRIDO!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:794
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ad5c60eb:

    # MC @ smile "Hm? What's this?"
    MC @ smile "¿Hm? ¿Qué es esto?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:795
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_38530319:

    # "Taking the book from her mouth, Elena's tail wagged as she waited for me look at it."
    "Quitándole el libro de la boca, Elena movió la cola mientras esperaba a que lo mirara."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:796
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_a77399d3:

    # "{i}The dreams of Ashara - A love story.{/i}"
    "{i}Los sueños de Ashara - Una historia de amor.{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:797
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_fce6108b:

    # MC "(This is that book I've heard everyone is reading ... Apparently it's very good.)"
    MC "(Este es ese libro que he oído que todo el mundo está leyendo... Aparentemente es muy bueno)."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:798
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ddf70b53:

    # MC @ smile "Thank you, Elena."
    MC @ smile "Gracias, Elena."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:799
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_2e68abed:

    # MC @ talk "When Erika leaves, we'll talk properly."
    MC @ talk "Cuando Erika se vaya, hablaremos apropiadamente."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:800
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_969ad7cc_1:

    # ELENA "BARK!"
    ELENA "¡LADRIDO!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:801
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_e872ca60:

    # "Elena moved to curl up in a ball and waited patiently for Erika to leave."
    "Elena se enroscó en una bola y esperó pacientemente a que Erika se marchara."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:805
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_829f966b:

    # "A letter with extremely poor writing was resting on top of a small jar of what seemed like ... slime?"
    "Una carta con una letra extremadamente pobre descansaba sobre un pequeño frasco de lo que parecía... ¿slime?"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:806
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_ffa0ad38:

    # "{i}MYU WISH HAPHY DAY, PHLES USE WHEN MYU NO HERE- LOVE MYU{/i}"
    "{i}MYU DESEO FELI DÍA, FAVO USO CUANDO MYU NO AQUÍ- AMOR MYU{/i}"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:807
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_b9980011:

    # "Looking towards the small jar, as I picked it up in my hand immediately, the slime inside reacted slightly, and seemed to be pouring out of the glass towards me."
    "Mirando hacia el pequeño frasco, al cogerlo en mi mano inmediatamente, el slime de su interior reaccionó ligeramente, y pareció verterse fuera del cristal hacia mí."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:808
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_d400f042:

    # "Realizing it {i}was{/i} a part of Myu, I could sense arousal radiating from the jar."
    "Al darme cuenta de que {i}era{/i} una parte de Myu, pude sentir la excitación que irradiaba del frasco."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:809
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_85b6db6a:

    # MC "(I think she wants me to... let it out when I'm turned on perhaps?)"
    MC "(Creo que ella quiere que... lo deje salir cuando esté excitado ¿quizás?)"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:835
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_120be1bf:

    # REGINA "[player_name!t]! Come take a seat!"
    REGINA "¡[player_name!t]! ¡Ven a sentarte!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:813
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_gifts_24e17665:

    # MC @ talk "Coming now!"
    MC @ talk "¡Ya voy!"

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:843
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_c8d17a3a:

    # "For the rest of the evening, I sat down with [regina_ref!t] and Erika to enjoy the hot feast prepared, chatting and laughing together as the world outside didn't seem to matter."
    "Durante el resto del anochecer, me senté con [regina_ref!t] y Erika a disfrutar del festín caliente preparado, charlando y riendo todos juntos mientras el mundo exterior parecía no importar."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:821
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_e6ac4c58:

    # "For just a few hours, we were together, we were happy, and the war and all of its horrors seemed so very far away."
    "Durante unas horas, estuvimos juntos, fuimos felices, y la guerra y todos sus horrores parecían muy lejanos."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:822
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_54157c65:

    # "I think I know that these days can't last forever, some terrible darkness I can feel draws ever closer, and the endless battles and wars still rage on outside."
    "Creo que sé que estos días no pueden durar para siempre, una terrible oscuridad que puedo sentir se acerca cada vez más, y las interminables batallas y guerras siguen haciendo estragos en el exterior."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:823
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_e9195ccb:

    # "I somehow know, I will end up caught in the crosswinds of it's blaze."
    "De algún modo sé que acabaré atrapado en sus vientos cruzados."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:824
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_391c37b3:

    # "I knew, there were more battles to come."
    "Sabía que vendrían más batallas."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:826
translate es ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_540147d8:

    # "...But what the hell's the point of spending your life fighting if you just end up alone in the end?"
    "...¿Pero de qué demonios sirve pasarse la vida luchando si al final acabas solo?"

